@DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5063

### Liveness and database reachability
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Everything the dashboard landing page needs, in one call
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

### KPI tiles: latest value, change since the previous release, change year over year
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/kpis?seriesKeys=cpi,sofr
Accept: application/json

### Trend, bucket width chosen automatically from the range and the densest series
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/trend?seriesKeys=cpi&from=2024-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Accept: application/json

### Trend, business-daily SOFR forced into monthly buckets (value is the mean; min/max carry the spread)
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/trend?seriesKeys=sofr&from=2024-01-01&to=2025-12-31&granularity=Month
Accept: application/json

### The SOFR distribution band: four measures read from the same daily rows
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/trend?seriesKeys=sofr.p1,sofr.p25,sofr.p75,sofr.p99&from=2026-01-01
Accept: application/json

### Publishers
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sources
Accept: application/json

### The series catalogue - seven measures across two datasets, latest value attached
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series
Accept: application/json

### Just one dataset's measures
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series?dataset=Sofr
Accept: application/json

### Search, over the title, the key, and the publisher's own code
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series?search=percentile
Accept: application/json

### One series
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/cpi
Accept: application/json

### Observations: current values, oldest first. For CPI that means monthly figures only
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/cpi/observations?from=2024-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Accept: application/json

### The annual averages BLS publishes alongside the months (period code M13)
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/cpi/observations?periodType=Annual
Accept: application/json

### One measure of the SOFR daily rows
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/sofr.volume/observations?from=2026-01-01
Accept: application/json

### Every vintage, including superseded ones
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/cpi/observations?from=2025-01-01&includeRevisions=true
Accept: application/json

### Point-in-time: what we believed on 15 July 2026, ignoring anything learned since
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/cpi/observations?from=2025-01-01&asOfUtc=2026-07-15T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Collection health per source, rolling 30-day window
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/collection/health
Accept: application/json

### Recent failures - the operations panel's default view
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/collection/runs?failuresOnly=true&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Pause a source without losing its history
PATCH {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sources/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEnabled": false
}

###
